  "provenance": {
    "designReference": "Generic Korean ergonomic chair; built-in generated master-chair-v3-attempt1.png, no logo.",
    "derivation": "Generated appearance master followed by native-grid geometric reauthoring. Exact frozen teal ramp, binary alpha, upper-left highlights in every orientation. No runtime mirrors.",
    "chairV3": "Rounded stepped 5px cushion; z21 mesh back, z13 arms, gas lift and five caster contacts. NE/NW cushion/base occlude the seated lower body; SE/SW cushion/base remain rear. Original part IDs/cells/anchors/ground keys/ranks preserved.",
    "limitations": "Low S0 back and arm height restrict ergonomic silhouette. Regeneration requires tools/split_iso_chair_occlusion.py before rebuilding the pack.",
    "seatedOcclusion": "NE/NW: complete authored cushion and lift/caster base pixels move from rear-00 (-20) to front-00 (20). Far arm remains rear. Disjoint empty RGBA union is unchanged; no actor-shaped cuts."
  }
